Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "PedestrianFollowingRollingBallInFog" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :hasActor :pedestrian1 ;
    :hasObstacle :ball1 ;
    :hasEvidence :indicator1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :foggy1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:pedestrian1 a :Pedestrian .
:ball1 a :RoadObject .
:indicator1 a :RollingBallIndicator ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1 .
:foggy1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Child running into road after a ball in low visibility conditions" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Child running into the road to retrieve a ball in foggy, low-visibility conditions.
Severity Score: 0.95